      {
        "note_id": "vdn-a374396f6529",
        "title": "Lighting problems",
        "steps": [
          {
            "text": "[RÉPONSE ACCEPTÉE] In Roblox Studio, in the Lighting part, you can always change the appearence of the Ambient, Outdoor Ambient, brightness and etc by changing their values.",
            "source_note": "vdn-a374396f6529",
            "source_urls": [
              "https://devforum.roblox.com/t/1183833"
            ],
            "verified": false,
            "origin": "source_excerpt"
          },
          {
            "text": "In case you want to change to another lighting, find the property called “Technology” and in there, you can choose 4 types of lights: Compatibility, Future, ShadowMap and Voxel.",
            "source_note": "vdn-a374396f6529",
            "source_urls": [
              "https://devforum.roblox.com/t/1183833"
            ],
            "verified": false,
            "origin": "source_excerpt"
          }
        ],
        "sources": [
          "https://devforum.roblox.com/t/1183833"
        ],
